.SH NAME
lmm-plugins-rules-group-remove - Remove a group no rule uses


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlmm plugins rules group remove <group> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a plugin group. A group a plugin rule puts a plugin in, or
another group loads after, is refused: change those first.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	print what would change without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for remove


